WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:02.012
That was the old model.

00:00:02.012 --> 00:00:05.726
Officials behind a screen,
waiting for instructions.

00:00:06.230 --> 00:00:07.410
Today, the new command.

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:10.397
Active people integrating
their knowledge into the

00:00:10.397 --> 00:00:13.811
solution and coordinating
resources from the command post.

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:20.371
GusCoordina articulates
institutions in real time.

00:00:20.371 --> 00:00:25.415
Six specialized agents per incident,
with reports and permanent traceability.

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:28.486 line:78% position:25% size:48%
Everyone is notified instantly.

00:00:28.486 --> 00:00:33.878 line:78% position:25% size:48%
Information is handled and articulated
permanently, in daily operations and in crisis.
